<!-- ════════════════ 15 · SKILLS ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Skills" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #16a34a;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">15</span>Extend</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Package a workflow into a <span class="accent">skill</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 36px; align-content: start;">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Claude Code</span>
          <h3>Skills</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><code>.claude/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</code> with a description.</li>
            <li>The agent invokes it itself when the task fits.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Cursor</span>
          <h3>Skills <span style="font-size: 0.55em; opacity: 0.7;">(2.4+)</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li><code>.cursor/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</code>.</li>
            <li>Invoked with <code>/skill</code>, or by the agent itself.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">GitHub Copilot</span>
          <h3>Skills</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><code>.github/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</code> (since late 2025).</li>
            <li>Automatically via the description, or with <code>/</code>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Difference from a command: a <strong>skill is invoked by the agent</strong> based on the description; a command you invoke yourself.
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #94a3b8; margin: 14px 4px 0;">SKILL.md is an open standard: the same file works in Claude Code, Cursor and Copilot. <strong>Source:</strong> VS Code docs, Agent Skills (code.visualstudio.com) &middot; GitHub Changelog (dec 2025).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "15" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "41" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
